WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.552 --> 00:00:07.944
When both sets of parents walk in wearing matching hanbok colors, it creates a sense of unity.

2
00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:13.680
But if their tastes or preferred colors differ, it can become a source of friction.

3
00:00:14.016 --> 00:00:19.392
These days many parents have strong personal style, so choosing their own preferred color is common too.

4
00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:25.608
Matching isn't mandatory, so just coordinate well between both families.

5
00:00:25.944 --> 00:00:33.192
Picking hanbok together can lead to small tensions over these choices, so going separately is often easier.

6
00:00:33.528 --> 00:00:39.624
Whichever family chooses first can send photos, and the other side can decide whether to match or go their own way.
